    </section>

    {homeV3ShiftVariant === 'contrast' && (
    <section class="home-v3-shift" data-home-v3-reveal>
      <div class="dm-grid-l dm-grid-l--grid-sys home-v3-shift-layout">
        <div class="home-v3-section-head home-v3-section-head--compact gc-start-2 gc-span-8">
          <p class="home-v3-section-label">What changes</p>
          <h2>When design leadership is working, teams feel it in how decisions get made and how execution moves.</h2>
          <p>
            Outcomes matter, but the mechanism matters too. This is where direction becomes easier to defend, execution becomes easier to trust, and teams stop paying avoidable alignment debt.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="home-v3-shift-panels gc-start-11 gc-span-15">
